135
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:48,680
A. And the division, the split grows wider.

136
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:56,280
K. So religion, when one asks, what is religion,

137
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,960
it is the image of the human being.

138
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:05,320
So religion, when one asks, what is religion,

