169
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,840
And therefore he balks at

170
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,200
that, and he won't do it.

171
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:24,840
K. No, because, sir, the brain needs security.

172
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,440
Otherwise it can't function. A. That's right.

173
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:32,520
K. So it finds security in a belief.

174
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:37,720
In an image, in rituals, in the

175
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:40,840
