207
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,880
And the very seeing of

208
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,880
what is false is the truth.

209
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:46,240
And the very seeing of

210
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:48,200
what is false is the truth.

211
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,280
Right? A. Yes, of course.

212
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:54,200
K. And that denies, that sweeps away all this.

213
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:59,000
I don't know if I'm making myself clear.

214
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,640
A. Well, I had a

215
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,280
