236
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:18,200
Mind you, she'd already gone through this whole statement,

237
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,960
which was very beautifully undertaken.

238
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,079
And I come along, playing the

239
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:24,760
