00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,240
that any time when you were doing this

243
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:34,360
that you thought of yourself looking at the tree?

244
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:35,720
K. That's the observer.

245
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,960
A. And with this hesitation,

246
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:40,160
she began to fall more and

247
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:42,360
more out of her own act.

248
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:48,200
Well, we had a look at that.

249
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:51,200
She and I and the class, we all

250
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:53,240
had a look at what she was doing.

251
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,680
Finally, she turned around and said,

252
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,600
well, the reason that I stopped

