255
00:18:01,320 --> 00:18:02,920
I'm very clear about that.

256
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:05,000
It's because I'm in class now,

257
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,760
it's because I'm in class now,

258
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,880
and I'm thinking that I

259
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,200
ought to say the right thing.

260
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:14,200
And so I've gone and ruined the whole thing.

261
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:16,680
It was a revelation not only to her,

262
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,600
but you could see with respect

263
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:20,520
