539
00:34:58,040 --> 00:35:00,040
Interesting. K. Yes, very, very interesting.

540
00:35:00,040 --> 00:35:02,760
A. Isn't it? It's always called the knowledge.

541
00:35:02,760 --> 00:35:03,560
K. Knowledge.

542
00:35:06,360 --> 00:35:08,640
A. Yes. Of course, I

