595
00:37:44,600 --> 00:37:46,840
A. It's amazing what's been going on

596
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,960
in terms of the relation

597
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:51,080
between men on the one hand

598
00:37:51,080 --> 00:37:52,800
