00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:26,040
they are faced with this problem.

630
00:39:26,040 --> 00:39:27,240
A. Oh, they are, yes.

631
00:39:27,240 --> 00:39:28,440
Yes, there's no question about that.

632
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:32,120
K. And so we say, look, let's start a school,

633
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:35,960
which we have in India,

634
00:39:35,960 --> 00:39:38,680
which we're going to do in California, at Ojai.

