00:46:29,329 --> 00:46:34,290
And that immediately opens up a hunger, doesn't it?

757
00:46:34,290 --> 00:46:40,210
And my projection of my meal I've run madly to.

758
00:46:40,210 --> 00:46:41,949
K. You see, when you

